      "source": "Returns the native client if available in this vector store implementation.\n\nNote on usage: 1. Returns empty Optional when no native client is available 2. Due\nto Java type erasure, runtime type checking is not possible\n\nExample usage: When working with implementation with known native client:\nOptional<nativeclienttype> client = vectorStore.getNativeClient();\n\nNote: Using Optional<span class=\"invalid-tag\">invalid input: '&lt;'</span>?&gt; will return the native client if one exists, rather than an\nempty Optional. For type safety, prefer using the specific client type.</nativeclienttype>",
      "translation": "返回当前向量存储实现中可用的原生客户端。\n\n使用注意事项：1. 若无可用原生客户端，则返回空 Optional；2. 由于 Java 类型擦除，无法进行运行时类型检查。\n\n使用示例：在与已知原生客户端的实现协作时：Optional<nativeclienttype> client = vectorStore.getNativeClient();\n\n注意：使用 Optional<span class=\"invalid-tag\">无效输入：'&lt;'</span>?&gt; 将返回存在的原生客户端，而非空 Optional。为确保类型安全，建议使用特定的客户端类型。</nativeclienttype>",
      "count": 1
    },
